# Cursor & AI Coding Assistant Rules for JIV Fleet
# Read AGENTS.md and GEMINI.md for full codebase details.

# Project Architecture Rules:
1. Always use standard Data Provider adapters from `src/lib/providers/` when fetching vessels.
2. Never hardcode fake vessel stubs in UI components. Always return clean arrays from providers.
3. Use `formatCurrencyPrice` and `convertFromRUB` from `src/lib/currency.ts` for price displays.
4. All icons MUST be imported from `lucide-react`.
5. Use Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes. Do NOT create custom `.css` files.
6. Server entry point is `server.ts`. Express handles API routes `/api/*` and Vite middleware handles frontend SPA.
7. Swagger UI is served at `/api/docs` and OpenAPI JSON at `/api/openapi.json`.
